; An archive to a runnable model for the whole-model drivers, in either dialect:
; the Loop bundle, the constants it binds, and the per-edge reference evaluator
; that dialect's drivers shadow against. Native is the lowered archive as it
; stands; Native4D is the canonical passes followed by the checked four-axis
; lowering, and a model outside the dialect is a typed refusal, never a Native
; run. One definition so `--dialect=native4d` means the same thing in every
; driver.

(library
 (name loop_native4d_model)
 (libraries
  err_trace
  fmt
  loop_ir
  loop_native4d
  native
  native4d
  native_interp
  pt2))
